    ⟨[(false, fun σ => QFact.knows (msg_a alice bob (σ .sid_a)))],
      .or (.fact false fun _ => QFact.event (LeakS phase0 bob))
        (.and (.fact false fun σ => QFact.event (LeakS (σ .px) bob))
          (.fact false fun σ => QFact.event (LeakS (σ .pz) alice)))⟩

/-- The variables of `query c, m, sid_a, sid_b, s, b, px, py, pz; attacker(msg_a(alice, bob, sid_a))`. -/
inductive Vars₉
